WEBVTT

00:14.070 --> 00:17.020
♪Tear up all the memories of the past♪

00:18.200 --> 00:20.860
♪Let go of all regrets♪

00:20.860 --> 00:26.260
♪I exchange my whole life for a change♪

00:27.740 --> 00:31.290
♪If I decide to let my guard down♪

00:31.830 --> 00:36.120
♪Will I fall for the wrong one♪

00:37.080 --> 00:40.630
♪I dare to give
without fear of destruction♪

00:41.620 --> 00:43.830
♪Love refuses to fall asleep♪

00:43.830 --> 00:46.870
♪I dare to shake heaven and earth♪

00:46.870 --> 00:48.950
♪Even with different paths and goals♪

00:48.950 --> 00:53.020
♪I have no regrets♪

00:53.530 --> 00:58.300
♪Because you're
an unsolvable riddle by fate♪

00:58.300 --> 01:02.580
♪I pray for a miracle♪

01:02.580 --> 01:03.990
♪Over the time♪

01:03.990 --> 01:06.010
♪Even if I'm burned out♪

01:06.010 --> 01:08.860
♪I'm willing to search for the miracle♪

01:08.860 --> 01:12.120
♪Of being with you forever♪

01:12.120 --> 01:16.820
♪I will travel with you all the way♪

01:17.530 --> 01:25.180
♪Love is the most beautiful in life♪

01:37.850 --> 01:43.210
=Sword and Fairy=

01:43.509 --> 01:46.830
=Episode 29=

01:50.759 --> 01:51.800
Is there another way?

02:04.360 --> 02:05.880
I knew it would come to this.

02:07.560 --> 02:09.759
If there was another way to save Huan,

02:11.080 --> 02:13.160
you wouldn't make this choice.

02:16.200 --> 02:17.240
I knew the answer

02:18.480 --> 02:20.079
but I couldn't help asking you.

02:22.600 --> 02:26.360
I was hoping to find evidence
in the last three years

02:27.800 --> 02:30.520
to prove that the past could be changed.

02:32.440 --> 02:35.440
I even kept him away
from Mangwan Village.

02:37.280 --> 02:40.600
But in the end, nothing has changed.

02:44.160 --> 02:47.520
Back then, you delayed
Zhu Yu's transformation

02:48.760 --> 02:52.000
with the power of Mist Soul
to contain her.

02:53.200 --> 02:55.280
Thus, you were cursed,

02:55.280 --> 02:57.720
causing severe decay of your viscera.

02:59.200 --> 03:04.520
Otherwise, you would have chosen to
resonate with Qi by yourself.

03:08.400 --> 03:09.680
All these years,

03:11.160 --> 03:15.000
Huan and I have always
been afraid of losing you.

03:20.600 --> 03:21.680
Today,

03:23.180 --> 03:28.160
you're getting a taste of this feeling.

03:38.480 --> 03:40.120
You are afraid, aren't you?

03:45.760 --> 03:46.960
It's perfectly normal

03:48.680 --> 03:50.200
to be afraid of losing loved ones.

03:51.480 --> 03:52.560
All these years,

03:53.400 --> 03:57.120
Huan and I have been
afraid of losing you.

04:06.800 --> 04:10.260
Xuwei, Qingfei, where is Luohuan going?

04:10.260 --> 04:11.310
He wouldn't tell me.

04:13.960 --> 04:17.279
He's going somewhere far, far away.

05:15.520 --> 05:20.360
Luohuan, it's getting late.
They're not coming.

05:22.040 --> 05:23.060
It's not time yet.

05:25.400 --> 05:28.400
Did something happen
to Jinzhao and Little Yue?

05:31.240 --> 05:32.240
Guards.

05:36.200 --> 05:37.440
You're truly heartless.

05:38.040 --> 05:41.040
Are you going to grab us
and throw us down?

05:44.920 --> 05:46.240
I'm asking you to stay.

05:47.440 --> 05:49.640
Let's see if you can.

05:51.240 --> 05:54.280
What's the matter, Ying Xuwei?

05:58.480 --> 05:59.540
You don't trust us?

06:01.960 --> 06:03.000
Jinzhao, Little Yue.

06:04.080 --> 06:05.170
You shouldn't have come back.

06:06.160 --> 06:07.600
We'd never abandon our friends.

06:09.440 --> 06:10.450
You're right.

06:12.280 --> 06:14.400
Of course, I wouldn't misjudge someone.

06:16.440 --> 06:18.560
I'm ready. Let's go.

06:21.240 --> 06:22.260
Let's go.

06:28.880 --> 06:29.900
Let's go.

06:35.640 --> 06:38.600
Qingfei, Xiaoyuan, take care.

07:03.600 --> 07:06.560
Qingfei, why can't I see Luohuan off?

07:07.080 --> 07:09.320
I wanted him to bring me gifts.

07:11.880 --> 07:14.760
Have you copied the scriptures?
Don't be so naughty.

07:16.320 --> 07:18.280
I just want to see Luohuan off.

07:18.880 --> 07:20.440
I can copy the scripture later.

07:21.160 --> 07:22.680
Anyway, Luohuan will help.

07:36.520 --> 07:37.580
Bian Luohuan.

07:41.840 --> 07:43.000
You're in a good mood?

07:45.360 --> 07:48.159
Would you rather see me cry?

07:50.720 --> 07:55.060
True, if I were the one
being sent to die, I'd be afraid.

07:57.040 --> 07:58.920
Just a few days ago,
you saw me as a deadly enemy.

07:59.440 --> 08:02.440
But now you're talking to me so calmly.

08:02.960 --> 08:03.960
It's so strange.

08:07.920 --> 08:08.960
Strange, indeed.

08:10.160 --> 08:13.280
Consider it me feeling sorry for myself.

08:14.920 --> 08:17.200
You think we are the same?

08:20.960 --> 08:23.960
I did wonder if we were the same person
in the beginning.

08:25.320 --> 08:26.680
But later, I realized

08:27.760 --> 08:30.440
that we were worlds apart.

08:34.039 --> 08:35.120
How so?

08:35.679 --> 08:38.600
You're stingy, cheap,
and slick with words.

08:38.600 --> 08:39.630
Enough...

08:40.720 --> 08:43.159
I knew you wouldn't say anything nice.

08:45.640 --> 08:49.400
But I slowly changed my opinion of you

08:50.800 --> 08:53.560
until I came to see you in a new light.

08:57.760 --> 09:02.520
Forget it. To be honest,
I became who I am today

09:03.560 --> 09:04.560
partly thanks to you.

09:06.000 --> 09:09.040
What you've been through
made you what you are now.

09:10.200 --> 09:12.160
Exactly. I am just me.

09:13.080 --> 09:15.840
Anyway, we are completely different.

09:17.280 --> 09:18.290
Yeah.

09:21.320 --> 09:24.560
Now that I think about it,
I chose the name

09:25.760 --> 09:27.400
"Yue Jinzhao" by myself.

09:30.640 --> 09:32.520
What does it mean?

09:34.760 --> 09:38.640
Surpass the past self.
Everything starts from today.

09:44.840 --> 09:45.880
Good name.

09:49.960 --> 09:52.720
How are they suddenly getting along?

09:58.000 --> 10:01.440
Little Yue, back when you were treated

10:01.440 --> 10:03.120
as a piece of weapon at Yujie Hub,

10:03.640 --> 10:05.200
it must have been hard for you.

10:08.200 --> 10:11.840
Actually, my decade or so at Yujie Hub

10:11.840 --> 10:14.120
wasn't as miserable as you all imagined.

10:15.240 --> 10:16.270
How come?

10:19.160 --> 10:20.480
Bian Luohuan was nice to me.

10:25.120 --> 10:30.440
He accompanied me as I grew up,
educated me, and taught me swordplay.

10:31.800 --> 10:35.000
He would try his best
to give me whatever I wanted.

10:37.760 --> 10:38.830
But...

10:39.840 --> 10:42.360
(What should I say to that?)

10:43.080 --> 10:44.800
But a bird kept in a cage

10:46.360 --> 10:50.120
lives in an illusion
without freedom, after all.

10:54.000 --> 10:56.000
It's different when I'm with Jinzhao.

10:58.480 --> 11:00.800
He showed me around
the Mortal Realm for three years.

11:01.640 --> 11:05.160
There may have been hardships,
but I was truly alive.

11:10.200 --> 11:13.520
The Resonance Spell between us
was never about control.

11:15.560 --> 11:17.400
It's the bond between us.

11:23.120 --> 11:24.210
Thanks.

11:48.720 --> 11:50.720
Mr. Ying, by decree of Her Lordship,

11:51.280 --> 11:52.320
enter the hall alone.

11:58.760 --> 12:01.120
Ying Xuwei, we'll wait for you here.

12:07.720 --> 12:08.780
Miss Shuo Xuan.

12:10.920 --> 12:13.400
Do you know
what the Qiyuan Orbs are for?

12:14.640 --> 12:16.360
The Hengdao Sect
offers them to Her Lordship

12:16.880 --> 12:19.080
to keep their
sad little hole of spring safe.

12:20.960 --> 12:23.680
Each orb is a human life.

12:25.520 --> 12:27.920
They don't feel guilty about it.

12:27.920 --> 12:28.960
Why should I?

12:29.960 --> 12:32.640
Besides, without the Qiyuan Orbs,

12:33.440 --> 12:35.160
how would Her Lordship cure my people?

12:45.360 --> 12:49.420
So, that's what you've been thinking.

12:53.480 --> 12:54.560
Are you troubled because

12:55.680 --> 12:57.320
you don't know whom to side with

12:58.480 --> 12:59.570
if we fight Shuo Xuan?

13:02.640 --> 13:07.160
No, I'm worried
about Jinzhao and Little Yue.

13:08.880 --> 13:09.960
Miss Shuo Xuan and I

13:11.400 --> 13:14.920
want to protect different things.

13:17.840 --> 13:21.160
Miss Shuo Xuan, goodbye.

13:40.760 --> 13:42.440
You want to enter Mist Soul.

13:45.200 --> 13:46.220
Yes.

13:52.520 --> 13:53.800
What if I don't allow it?

13:59.440 --> 14:01.840
Once upon a time, Shennong said,

14:02.600 --> 14:06.200
'What has passed
is all predestined and bound to happen.'

14:07.360 --> 14:10.800
If someone forcibly changes history

14:10.800 --> 14:12.520
and disrupts the stream of time,

14:12.520 --> 14:15.600
it will lead to the collapse and chaos
of the entire universe.

14:18.040 --> 14:22.040
Bian Luohuan went through Mist Soul
to exchange for Yue Jinzhao.

14:22.600 --> 14:25.920
The encounter between Yue Jinzhao
and Qi is an established history.

14:26.960 --> 14:32.560
If you insist on preventing us
from entering Mist Soul,

14:33.600 --> 14:37.920
which prohibits Huan
from exchanging for Yue Jinzhao,

14:37.920 --> 14:41.760
then Qi wouldn't meet Jinzhao
and the history would be changed.

14:42.400 --> 14:45.040
The entire universe would collapse.

14:46.160 --> 14:48.720
The Yu Clan would also cease to exist.

14:54.960 --> 14:57.480
Even if I don't
grant you access to Mist Soul,

14:59.560 --> 15:03.400
other factors will ensure that
the story takes the predestined course.

15:11.120 --> 15:15.960
Ying Xuwei, I may
allow you to enter Mist Soul.

15:17.680 --> 15:22.760
But I want
the key ring of Rehai in exchange.

15:28.120 --> 15:31.280
Someone will bring it here
once they enter Mist Soul.

15:32.920 --> 15:36.520
Alright, if you break your word,

15:38.240 --> 15:40.320
I swear I will wipe out the Yujie Hub.

16:07.080 --> 16:08.140
We're here.

16:09.240 --> 16:11.880
I don't know
why Her Lordship let you in.

16:14.160 --> 16:16.680
Xuwei, open up Mist Soul.

17:01.080 --> 17:05.079
The Time Rift only lasts
for a moment, hurry.

17:06.040 --> 17:07.089
Let's get in.

17:09.240 --> 17:10.290
Come on.

17:27.000 --> 17:28.079
Luohuan.

17:32.320 --> 17:34.440
Yes, Xuwei?

17:40.640 --> 17:41.650
Go ahead.

17:46.960 --> 17:48.020
Take care, all of you.

18:15.360 --> 18:18.720
This place seems detached from reality.

18:20.120 --> 18:22.200
It's more desolate than
the other holes of springs

18:22.200 --> 18:23.360
we've been to

18:23.960 --> 18:25.760
as if it is no longer in this world.

18:27.120 --> 18:29.280
The Split Abyss and the Time Rift

18:30.200 --> 18:33.480
are beyond the Six Realms.
They are indeed otherworldly.

18:34.280 --> 18:37.560
We managed to get here thanks to fate.

18:39.760 --> 18:40.760
How do we determine

18:41.280 --> 18:42.760
which point in time to return to?

18:43.760 --> 18:45.800
The stream of time will tell us.

18:55.240 --> 18:56.270
It may be dangerous.

18:57.480 --> 18:59.560
Wait for us outside just in case.

19:01.080 --> 19:02.100
Okay.

19:03.320 --> 19:04.370
Let's go.

19:06.600 --> 19:07.630
Let's go.

19:21.920 --> 19:24.880
This is the secret chamber
of Luori Village.

19:25.920 --> 19:28.680
Aren't we supposed
to go back to Yujie Hub?

19:29.330 --> 19:30.800
How did we end up here?

19:30.800 --> 19:32.160
I bet the stream of time

19:32.800 --> 19:33.800
led us here for a reason.

19:38.120 --> 19:39.480
What about the slaves?

19:40.840 --> 19:44.800
Don't worry,
our past selves will save them.

19:54.880 --> 19:56.880
It's the box we use
to store the Qiyuan Orbs.

19:56.880 --> 19:57.920
- Watch out.
- Qi.

20:07.120 --> 20:10.520
Oh right, you're the one
who set up the trap.

20:32.920 --> 20:34.440
You forgot everything, yet you

20:35.280 --> 20:36.520
risked yourself for me.

20:39.720 --> 20:43.280
After all, you are my master.

20:53.040 --> 20:54.100
Shifang.

20:54.720 --> 20:55.790
The Dragon Crystal.

20:56.920 --> 20:57.940
Okay.

21:03.400 --> 21:06.680
This Dragon Crystal
led us to Wuyan Village.

21:09.280 --> 21:10.600
There, we met Uncle Lin Yuan

21:11.800 --> 21:13.080
and learned about Qi's identity.

21:15.000 --> 21:18.200
We must guide our future selves

21:18.840 --> 21:19.880
to do the same things.

21:51.680 --> 21:53.720
It's us from three years ago, hurry up.

22:06.160 --> 22:07.250
How did it go?

22:07.800 --> 22:09.880
It seems that once we do our job,

22:10.520 --> 22:11.720
we'll be sent back here.

22:12.560 --> 22:14.800
That saves us a lot of trouble.

22:21.880 --> 22:24.760
Let's go. It's time
to steal my past self.

22:25.840 --> 22:28.560
Guys, it only concerns the three of us.

22:29.520 --> 22:30.580
Let us deal with it.

22:32.560 --> 22:34.440
Okay, let's meet up here later.

22:35.600 --> 22:36.840
Qi, let's go.

22:48.880 --> 22:50.770
(Three years ago)

22:55.560 --> 22:56.590
Master.

22:59.520 --> 23:02.000
Master, take me
to the Mortal Realm for fun, please.

23:03.560 --> 23:07.480
Naughty kid. Practice your swordplay.
All you think about is to play.

23:07.480 --> 23:13.000
Master, I've lain in the Sea of Clouds
for a decade a Kun.

23:13.000 --> 23:15.840
Then I stayed in Yujie Hub
for years in the human form.

23:15.840 --> 23:18.560
It's been a whole decade and more.

23:18.560 --> 23:20.880
I've come to know every single ant here.

23:20.880 --> 23:22.840
Master, please.

23:22.840 --> 23:25.400
Take me to the Mortal Realm, please.

23:25.400 --> 23:28.760
Please, you've been nagging so much
that my ears are developing calluses.

23:28.760 --> 23:30.720
Check it out. All thanks to you.

23:30.720 --> 23:31.730
- See?
- There's nothing.

23:33.400 --> 23:35.920
Please, take me out for fun.

23:35.920 --> 23:37.920
I really want some fun.

23:38.480 --> 23:42.030
Master, you are the best.
Please take me out.

23:42.030 --> 23:43.680
Fine...

23:46.880 --> 23:48.680
Go practice
at the Hundred-Foot Spring Platform.

23:48.680 --> 23:50.520
I'll plead with Xuwei

23:50.520 --> 23:52.720
to see if I can take you out, alright?

23:52.720 --> 23:54.280
You must keep your word.

23:54.280 --> 23:56.640
Of course. When have I
ever gone back on word?

24:24.000 --> 24:25.280
It's only been three years,

24:27.280 --> 24:28.600
yet it feels like ages.

24:30.800 --> 24:33.910
♪Burns what once was♪

24:34.870 --> 24:37.680
♪The name is forgotten♪

24:41.840 --> 24:45.780
♪The deep feelings are hidden
behind the mask♪

24:46.900 --> 24:49.900
♪Only through the eyes♪

24:52.600 --> 24:55.280
Let's go. It's time
to steal your past self.

24:56.320 --> 24:58.600
Wait, let me do it.

25:00.400 --> 25:05.240
Can I have a minute alone with her?

25:07.280 --> 25:10.560
I'd like to bid her farewell formally.

25:12.050 --> 25:19.790
♪I gave up everything
for a moment of heartfelt resonance♪

25:19.790 --> 25:26.800
♪Leaving love
with an unspoken explanation♪

25:41.520 --> 25:49.330
♪I'm destined
to brave all dangers for you♪

25:49.330 --> 25:56.850
♪Even if I cannot escape fate
in the end♪

25:57.780 --> 26:05.580
♪I gave up everything
for a moment of heartfelt resonance♪

26:05.580 --> 26:12.620
♪Leaving love
with an unspoken explanation♪

26:14.160 --> 26:16.000
Master, I know it's you.

26:19.760 --> 26:22.080
Master, stop hiding. Come out.

26:22.640 --> 26:28.400
♪Even if my efforts may go up in smoke♪

26:32.680 --> 26:35.280
Did Mr. Ying agree
to take us to the Mortal Realm?

26:41.360 --> 26:44.880
Master, what's wrong?
You're acting weird today.

26:48.720 --> 26:51.840
Qi, your Thought Sword
derives from your thoughts.

26:52.400 --> 26:53.880
Do you know your duty?

26:58.080 --> 26:59.560
(My duty?)

27:00.280 --> 27:02.840
Does it mean I have to kill someone?

27:03.920 --> 27:05.240
But I don't want to.

27:12.920 --> 27:14.760
Master, what are you doing?

27:18.400 --> 27:19.440
Master.

27:23.480 --> 27:26.380
Master, what are you doing?

28:02.560 --> 28:03.570
I'm taking you

28:06.840 --> 28:08.160
to the Mortal Realm for real.

28:21.560 --> 28:26.800
♪Twin flowers bloom on the same branch♪

28:27.440 --> 28:29.080
I've always wanted to give it to you.

28:33.520 --> 28:38.320
♪The sun rises and the moon sets♪

28:38.320 --> 28:43.120
♪Giving you a gentle answer♪

28:46.230 --> 28:48.460
♪Under the sycamore tree♪

28:49.300 --> 28:51.600
♪The rain is spattering♪

28:52.460 --> 28:56.880
♪Breaking off a branch
to exchange for the memories♪

28:58.510 --> 29:03.220
♪Like threads weaving misty rain
into a painting♪

29:03.220 --> 29:08.370
♪Forming a bond
reminiscent of a rainbow♪

29:08.370 --> 29:14.640
♪I promise you a lifetime
of joy and yearning♪

29:14.640 --> 29:20.880
♪Burying your past
in the hustle and bustle♪

29:20.880 --> 29:27.060
♪I'll accompany you
through ups and downs♪

29:27.730 --> 29:33.140
♪Don't be afraid♪

29:33.140 --> 29:39.380
♪Writing about your struggle♪

29:39.380 --> 29:45.520
♪Being irrational and silly
because of you♪

29:45.520 --> 29:51.340
♪Betting your whole life♪

29:55.480 --> 29:58.960
Bian Luohuan.

30:13.000 --> 30:14.030
So

30:17.360 --> 30:21.800
this is what I looked like
when you first saw me?

30:22.540 --> 30:26.130
♪Sending you
a priceless promise on my behalf♪

30:27.570 --> 30:32.400
♪Let worries melt away with the blood♪

30:32.400 --> 30:37.230
♪Can you hear my mumble of love♪

30:37.840 --> 30:43.820
♪I promise you a lifetime
of joy and yearning♪

30:43.820 --> 30:48.880
♪Burying your past
in the hustle and bustle♪

30:49.600 --> 30:50.670
Qi.

30:53.280 --> 30:54.380
Qi.

30:57.010 --> 31:02.510
♪Don't be afraid♪

31:02.510 --> 31:08.590
♪Writing about your struggle♪

31:08.590 --> 31:14.610
♪Being irrational and silly
because of you♪

31:14.610 --> 31:20.660
♪Betting your whole life♪

31:21.680 --> 31:22.740
Stop right there.

31:23.380 --> 31:24.430
Take her away.

31:36.800 --> 31:37.840
Luohuan.

31:47.760 --> 31:48.880
According to Ying Xuwei,

31:49.880 --> 31:53.040
Bian Luohuan will tell him
about the exchange here, let's go.

31:56.720 --> 32:00.080
Another person? What about you?

32:03.200 --> 32:06.280
Me? I need to go to Dragon Pool

32:07.720 --> 32:08.760
to exchange for this person.

32:15.160 --> 32:19.040
His name is Yue Jinzhao.

32:25.240 --> 32:26.280
Yue Jinzhao.

32:29.640 --> 32:30.800
Xuwei, do you remember?

32:31.720 --> 32:35.000
That's the name I once chose for myself.

32:38.360 --> 32:41.600
My father passed away when I was young
and my mom got ill

32:43.080 --> 32:44.200
from overwork.

32:46.240 --> 32:50.200
She would hit me, curse me,
and end up abandoning me.

32:51.760 --> 32:53.560
I got this scar on my face from then.

32:54.400 --> 32:57.200
You found me wandering the street

32:58.680 --> 33:00.920
and took me back to Yujie Hub.

33:02.920 --> 33:04.120
You asked for my name.

33:04.880 --> 33:07.440
I said my name was Yue Jinzhao.

33:08.240 --> 33:11.840
Surpass the past self.
Start everything anew.

33:16.280 --> 33:21.260
Do you remember what you said back then?

33:25.960 --> 33:29.520
To avoid the past is an evasion.

33:32.440 --> 33:36.320
Only by facing it,
can you truly move beyond.

33:37.600 --> 33:41.760
Yes, indeed.

33:47.680 --> 33:51.000
How I wish I could see
Qingfei and Xiaoyuan again.

33:58.830 --> 33:59.890
Goodbye.

34:00.520 --> 34:01.520
Huan.

34:09.280 --> 34:13.320
Xuwei, you are the strongest among us.

34:14.400 --> 34:17.280
You've been sheltering me
from all the wind and rain.

34:18.080 --> 34:21.400
Do me a favor one more time.

34:38.840 --> 34:39.889
Xuwei.

34:44.320 --> 34:45.360
This time,

34:49.000 --> 34:50.040
it's a real farewell.

35:19.320 --> 35:21.120
Xuwei, take care.

35:35.640 --> 35:36.660
Huan.

35:45.280 --> 35:46.350
Luohuan.

35:52.600 --> 35:53.680
Luohuan.

36:03.880 --> 36:05.120
Two Little Yue.

